---

<section class="features">
	<div class="container">
		<div class="section-header">
			<h2 class="section-title">Simplifica tu vida financiera</h2>
			<p class="section-subtitle">Todo lo que necesitas para tener el control total de tus finanzas en un solo lugar.</p>
		</div>
		
		<div class="features-grid">
			<div class="feature-card">
				<div class="feature-icon">
					<svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
						<path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"></path>
						<polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"></polyline>
						<line x1="12" y1="15" x2="12" y2="3"></line>
					</svg>
				</div>
				<h3>Captura Automática</h3>
				<p>Lee correos y SMS bancarios, extrae la información y crea registros automáticamente sin intervención manual.</p>
			</div>
			
			<div class="feature-card">
				<div class="feature-icon">
					<svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
						<path d="M21 11.5a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9 3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1-7.6 4.7 8.38 8.38 0 0 1-3.8-.9L3 21l1.9-5.7a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9-3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1 4.7-7.6 8.38 8.38 0 0 1 3.8-.9h.5a8.48 8.48 0 0 1 8 8v.5z"></path>
					</svg>
				</div>
				<h3>Asistente IA</h3>
				<p>Pregunta por gastos, tendencias o categorías en lenguaje natural. Tu asistente personal siempre disponible.</p>
			</div>
			
			<div class="feature-card">
				<div class="feature-icon">
					<svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
						<polyline points="22 12 18 12 15 21 9 3 6 12 2 12"></polyline>
					</svg>
				</div>
				<h3>Registro Rápido</h3>
				<p>Agrega transacciones con voz o texto directamente al asistente. Rápido, fácil e intuitivo.</p>
			</div>
			
			<div class="feature-card">
				<div class="feature-icon">
					<svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
						<rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
						<line x1="16" y1="2" x2="16" y2="6"></line>
						<line x1="8" y1="2" x2="8" y2="6"></line>
						<line x1="3" y1="10" x2="21" y2="10"></line>
					</svg>
				</div>
				<h3>Categorización Inteligente</h3>
				<p>La IA aprende de tus hábitos y categoriza automáticamente cada transacción con precisión.</p>
			</div>
			
			<div class="feature-card">
				<div class="feature-icon">
					<svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
						<path d="M12 2v20M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"></path>
					</svg>
				</div>
				<h3>Análisis en Tiempo Real</h3>
				<p>Visualiza tu salud financiera con gráficos y métricas actualizadas al instante.</p>
			</div>
			
			<div class="feature-card">
				<div class="feature-icon">
					<svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
						<rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
						<path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"></path>
					</svg>
				</div>
				<h3>Privacidad Total</h3>
				<p>Tus datos están encriptados y seguros. Solo tú tienes acceso a tu información financiera.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.container {
		max-width: 1200px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 0 2rem;
	}

	.features {
		padding: 6rem 0;
		background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent 0%, rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.02) 100%);
	}

	.section-header {
		text-align: center;
		max-width: 700px;
		margin: 0 auto 4rem;
	}

	.section-title {
		font-size: 2.5rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
		letter-spacing: -0.02em;
	}

	.section-subtitle {
		font-size: 1.125rem;
		color: var(--color-gray);
		line-height: 1.7;
	}

	.features-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
		gap: 2rem;
	}

	.feature-card {
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
		border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
		border-radius: 20px;
		padding: 2rem;
		transition: all 0.3s ease;
	}

	.feature-card:hover {
		background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.05);
		border-color: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.2);
		transform: translateY(-4px);
		box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
	}

	.feature-icon {
		width: 64px;
		height: 64px;
		background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.1) 0%, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.1) 100%);
		border-radius: 16px;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
	}

	.feature-icon svg {
		color: var(--color-accent);
	}

	.feature-card h3 {
		font-size: 1.25rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
		color: white;
	}

	.feature-card p {
		color: var(--color-gray);
		line-height: 1.6;
		font-size: 0.9375rem;
	}

	@media (max-width: 968px) {
		.features {
			padding: 4rem 0;
		}

		.section-title {
			font-size: 2rem;
		}

		.features-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			gap: 1.5rem;
		}
	}

	@media (max-width: 1200px) and (min-width: 769px) {
		.features-grid {
			grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
		}
	}
</style>
